# Privacy Policy

Nova Player is an open-source offline and network media player developed by Mayank (@xboyrex).

- Nova Player does not collect, store, or transmit any personal user data, analytics, or telemetry.
- Media files, playlists, vault PINs, and network credentials remain strictly on your local device.
- Network permissions are used solely for user-initiated network streaming (SMB, FTP, SFTP, WebDAV, HTTP/HTTPS, M3U) and checking GitHub Releases for optional in-app updates.
